  "review_notes": [
    "s033 is tagged R in the projection but carries the lemma אַל; it is read as the negative of the second prohibition, fused with its waw into 'nor' under rule 35.",
    "Reconciled with JOS.22.7: where one English connective is written for a waw standing before a discourse adverb, the adverb takes it and the waw is unrepresented. 'Howbeit' writes אַךְ's own lexeme, so אַךְ takes it here, exactly as גַּם takes 'Moreover' there."
  ]
